  "bodyHash": "Lzy7pDzgbFw=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RbGKNNu.png\" alt=\"Advent of Ascension\" width=\"1734\" height=\"113\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>欢迎来到Advent of Ascension！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Advent of Ascension是一个现代的冒险和探索沙盒模组，旨在扩展和延长原版游戏中的游戏体验，适合所有游戏风格。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">为主世界和下界添加新内容，并探索新的维度！</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">可以将其作为特色模组游玩，或将其添加到现有模组包中，以在不破坏平衡或稳定性的情况下增加更多内容！<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gTMX7b.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tzUqWFy.png\" alt=\"Overhauled\" width=\"570\" height=\"66\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">AoA正在从头开始重建，采用现代模组设计原则和风格。发现全新的体验！&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有生物都经过重新设计，拥有全新的AI、战利品、额外的互动和设计</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有维度都经过重新构想，拥有全新的世界生成、生物群系、生物和内容</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有技能都经过重新构想，采用全新的系统，既有趣又富有奖励</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有装备和物品都经过重新平衡，适合几乎任何模组包，不会破坏平衡</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">全新的Boss挑战系统，旨在挑战你的战斗技能，而不会变得枯燥</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gTMX7b.png\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadventofascension.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fBosses\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/e1FCxGD.png\" alt=\"Bosses\" width=\"305\" height=\"241\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadventofascension.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fArmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yHDEjxw.png\" alt=\"Equipment\" width=\"350\" height=\"240\"></a></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadventofascension.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fDimensions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/QwAJ0yA.png\" alt=\"Dimensions\" width=\"392\" height=\"204\"></span></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gTMX7b.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cB2uqpe.png\" alt=\"Optimised\" width=\"440\" height=\"66\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">AoA在优化和性能方面投入了大量精力，几乎可以在任何标准的Minecraft安装中运行，且只需适度的内存消耗。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gTMX7b.png\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Gxq6pHr.png\" alt=\"Full Wiki\" width=\"401\" height=\"66\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">AoA的最新版本在Minecraft模组中最详细的Fandom维基上完全记录。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">查找任何生物，查看任何武器，了解任何矿石——所有内容都在Advent of Ascension Fandom上详细解释。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadventofascension.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAdvent_of_Ascension_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/Fandom.svg\" alt=\"Fandom\" width=\"226\" height=\"57\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2gTMX7b.png\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Jkb7SaR.png\" alt=\"Links\" width=\"253\" height=\"66\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/DNYqNNq\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/6257adef93867e50d84d30e2/636e0b52aa9e99b832574a53_full_logo_blurple_RGB.png\" width=\"228\" height=\"43\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Tslat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Patreon_logo_(2023).svg/800px-Patreon_logo_(2023).svg.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"241\" height=\"40\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fadventofascension.fandom.com%252fwiki%252fAdvent_of_Ascension_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ce/Fandom.svg\" alt=\"Fandom\" width=\"226\" height=\"57\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrowdin.com%252fproject%252fadvent-of-ascension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://support.crowdin.com/assets/logos/core-logo/png/crowdin-core-logo-cDark.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"51\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252ftslat.net%252fHosting%252fTslat-AoA%252faoa_credits.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/S4nelnG.png\" alt=\"Credits\" width=\"308\" height=\"56\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
